    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d478">

                <pb facs="0609" n="529" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg529"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Sultan of Turkey to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Yildiz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-14"><hi rendition="#italic">September 14,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have learned with emotion of the tragic death of Mr. McKinley. I beg to express
                    to you the deep share I take in the sorrow caused by this event.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Abdul Hamid.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
